    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0595" n="1329" xml:id="pg1329"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr. Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 653.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose for your
                    information a full vindication of my official action here by the Rev. Dr. H. O.
                    Dwight in circular form for missionaries. This vindication, coming from so
                    distinguished a source, was as unexpected as it is pleasing. * * *</p>
                <p>Mr. Dwight has a national reputation among our Christian people.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d604-a1.xml" xpointer="d604-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
